ctic ice caves to desert dunes, floating sky islands, a neon city and a clockwork world. Quantum collected along the way unlocks new planes. The game includes online co-op with a friend, an untimed Free Fly mode, and online races against pilots worldwide.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/paperly-2", "videos": [{"id": 202725, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "41cL_gyI7Qg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=41cL_gyI7Qg", "title": "Paperly 2 | First Look | indie.io", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/41cL_gyI7Qg/fhddefault.jpg"}]}